WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.549 --> 00:00:11.199
We have divided in three our kingdom it is our fast intent to shake all cares and business for my age

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:15.400
Conferring among younger strengths. What can you say to draw a third?

00:00:16.129 --> 00:00:18.459
more opulent than your sisters

00:00:19.279 --> 00:00:21.279
Nothing my Lord

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:26.949
Nothing will come of nothing, speak again

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:31.500
Where's my daughter?

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:37.280
By day and night he wrongs me. Every hour he flushes into one gross crime or other, that sets us all at odds.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:38.820
I will not endure it

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:40.860
Who is it that will tell me who I am?

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.300
Why not by the hand, Sir?

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:45.820
How have I offended?

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:52.000
You are old. You should be ruled and led by some discretion that discerns your state

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:56.160
Thou art my daughter rather than disease. That's in my flesh.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.320
It's alright brother. It's alright

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:09.640
Here I stand. Your slave. I'm poor, infirm weak &amp;  despised on

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:16.220
To whose hands you have sent the lunatic case

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:32.280
I am a man more sinned against than sinning

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:37.680
Better though had'st not been born

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:42.080
And not off pleased me better

